# Copy this file to .env and edit. Restart `npm run dev` after changes.
VITE_NAME=Sai Prasanna
VITE_ROLE=Video editor
VITE_TAGLINE=Reels for clinics, founders and family milestones. Hooked in the first two seconds, held to the last frame.
# About section: a one-line headline, the main paragraph, and comma-separated skills.
VITE_BIO_LEAD=I turn raw phone footage into reels people actually finish watching.
VITE_BIO=From a dentist explaining a treatment to a family taking the keys to their new car, I find the moment that matters and build the whole edit around it. I've cut for dental clinics, a software company, a saree label and a kindergarten: tight pacing, clean sound and captions in Telugu and English that land with local audiences. Every project is edited in DaVinci Resolve and delivered ready to post.
VITE_SKILLS=Videography, Video pacing, Sound design, Color grading, AI motion graphics
